=== plugins/codex-consult/scripts/codex-findings.ps1 ===
3:     List the findings Codex raised in a task's consultations and move their status.
7:     <CollabDir>/<task>/findings.json as F<NN>-<k> with status 'proposed', and records
9:     coordinator moves a status - with this script. Every change appends a history
10:     record { when, status, by, note, evidence, base_commit, tree_sha256 } that
13:     Statuses: proposed | implemented | verified | rejected | wontfix | superseded.
14:     Any status can follow any other; the history is the audit trail.
15:       * verified requires -Evidence (what was run, or where the proof is)
16:       * rejected requires -Note (why)
17:       * back to proposed (a reopen) requires -Note
23:     current status of its findings; then a per-reviewer scoreboard - one line per
31:     consultation n of the task (n must be a ledger entry; -Note is required for no):
32:     findings.json gets a top-level `ratings` array of { n, consult_id, lineage,
33:     provider, model, engine, purpose, topics, consult_when, useful, note, when } -
34:     (wave 26, D2) keyed by the consultation's consult_id (n is kept for display), with
35:     everything routing needs copied from that ledger entry: the reviewer (provider, model,
